      <div type="clause" n="7.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEm">II Em</ref> 7.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðonne he ðæs beweddad hæbbe, ðone finde he ðærto wæreborh.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">When he has pledged himself to this, he shall find a surety for the payment of the wergeld.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ðonne he ðæs beweddad hæbbe, ðonne finde he ðærto wærborh.</ab>
